    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_finish_description_without_bp">Now when you pick up your phone or tap the screen, you can use your face to unlock.\n\nFace Unlock works best when there’s enough light and you’re not wearing a mask or dark glasses.</string>
    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_finish_description_without_bp_folded">Now when you pick up your phone or tap the screen, you can use your face to unlock. Your phone must be folded to use Face Unlock.\n\nFace Unlock works best when there’s enough light and you’re not wearing a mask or dark glasses.</string>
    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_introduction_control_consent_message_1">You and your child can delete their face model or turn off Face Unlock at any time in Settings. Face models are stored on the phone until they’re deleted.</string>
    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_introduction_how_consent_message_1">Face Unlock creates a unique model of your child’s face to verify it’s them. To create this face model during setup, your child will take images of their face from different angles.\n\nWhen they use Face Unlock, images are used to update their face model. Images used to create their face model are never stored, but the face model is stored securely on the phone and never leaves the phone. All processing occurs securely on the phone.</string>
